  "religion": {
    "_note": "Deity-names are second-order phoneme-morphs: the canonical Agrippan pantheon as morphed into Punic (Barcan) trade-forms, then drifted again through Akkadian phonology with an Egyptian solar-funerary coloring \u2014 never real Mesopotamian or Egyptian gods. Lawful/Neutral; a law-stele cult over a solar and tomb-cult overlay.",
